# NOTE: this repo is PRIVATE and deliberately tracks personal material —
# config.json, PERSONAL_CONTEXT.md, the learning plan, TODO_POSTS.md and the
# scored job CSVs. The public mirror is produced by sync_public.py, which
# withholds them; it does NOT read this file. Adding a personal file here
# hides it from the private repo without making the public one any safer.
